{"task":"transcribe","language":"en","duration":93.3546875,"text":"KFC is coming to Norway. That's the best news an international chicken brand could possibly get. A KFC franchisee has agreed to buy Fly Chicken, which is Norway's own chicken brand. It grew from 11 sites to 19, and most of those are being converted to KFC. The first openings are expected in early 2027. Now, look at who else is there. No Popeyes, no Wingstop, nobody. KFC is about to take the first rung of the ladder, and nobody holds the second. So here's how I think about it as an operator. Labour in Norway runs at roughly £21 an hour all in. So you need volume. Chicken gives you volume. And KFC is about to spend serious money. teaching Norway how to eat branded chicken. The number two in the market gets that education for free. If I ran an international chicken brand right now, I'd be in a Norwegian master franchise conversation this very quarter. Every Friday we provide you with a full report on a new country that you might want to think about entering with your franchise. Link in the comments, and we look forward to seeing you at WRW. Hospitality.","segments":[{"id":0,"seek":0,"start":6.16,"end":12.48,"text":" KFC is coming to Norway. That's the best news an international chicken brand could possibly get.","tokens":[],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":0.0,"compression_ratio":0.0,"no_speech_prob":0.0},{"id":1,"seek":0,"start":12.82,"end":19.12,"text":" A KFC franchisee has agreed to buy Fly Chicken, which is Norway's own chicken brand.","tokens":[],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":0.0,"compression_ratio":0.0,"no_speech_prob":0.0},{"id":2,"seek":0,"start":19.46,"end":25.56,"text":" It grew from 11 sites to 19, and most of those are being converted to KFC.","tokens":[],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":0.0,"compression_ratio":0.0,"no_speech_prob":0.0},{"id":3,"seek":0,"start":26.32,"end":29.96,"text":" The first openings are expected in early 2027.","tokens":[],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":0.0,"compres